    <section class="d-none card"><div class="card-body">
The results of the Novice Jack&Jill final during Bristol Swing Fiesta 2026 in  United Kingdom at 08/28/2026.<br />
<br />
Judges in this round were Nicole Moes, Fran Vidal, Mike Schrimshaw, Chloe Winzar, Audrey Disnard, Peter Fradley, Aleix Figueras and Ellen Dacombe.    </div></section>

